  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Welcome to SeaHaunts 1A -- a beautiful modern and updated Gulf-front townhome nestled in a quiet section of Blue Mountain Beach right off 30A. This 4-bedroom, 3 bath unit boasts breathtaking views with direct access to the sugar white sand and emerald water of the Gulf of Mexico. <br><br>The first level has a bunkroom, plus a bedroom with full bath with shower. Easily walk out to the beach path from here. The deck also includes a gas grill and shower. The second floor is a beautifully decorated living room that opens to an amazing kitchen to prepare vacation meals - all with stunning Gulf views. Behind the kitchen you'll also find a 2nd full bath. Up next on the third floor you’ll find a spacious master bedroom overlooking the Gulf with a private balcony to enjoy a cup of coffee in the morning or a drink in the afternoon. This bedroom shares a Jack-and-Jill bathroom with the 4th bedroom. All bedrooms come with TVs for your entertainment needs.<br><br>Immediately next door is the San Remo complex where you can access the pool and their fitness room. The pool is heated seasonally (call for dates) and features lap lanes and a spacious hot tub. <br><br>Up to 2 Dogs allowed. 50 pound maximum per dog, 150.00 pet fee per dog.<br><br>The location of this property allows the guests to enjoy the relaxed lifestyle Scenic 30A has to offer. Get away from the hustle and bustle and enjoy small boutique restaurants and shops. You will find an active art scene in this quiet out-of-the-way area of Blue Mountain Beach.<br><br>Your stay at Sea Haunts 1A comes with Xplorie’s best activities! one ticket per day, per activity! (over $800 in nightly value) Tee off at Emerald Bay or Regatta Bay, zip through Baytowne Adventure Zone, and sail on the Sea Blaster Dolphin Cruise. Enjoy Big Kahuna’s Water Park, Black Light Mini Golf, and scenic bike rides with complimentary rentals. Explore 30A with ease and adventure!<br><br> * Parking for 2 cars<br> * No smoking on property<br> * Pet Friendly: This property is pet friendly! If bringing a dog, please contact Reservations as an additional non-refundable pet fee will be added to your booking. A maximum of 2 dogs is allowed at a maximum of 30 lbs. Please see our rental policies for further details.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Modern & Updated, Gulf-Front, Steps to the Beach + Free Attraction Tickets!"
        }
      ],
